##
## package.json additions for the new operations.
##
## Runtime: NONE. The staged code in shared.ts, GenerateSyntheticDataFromSML-
## Operation.ts, and GenerateSyntheticDataFromConnectionOperation.ts is dependency-
## free beyond what the repo already ships. The Gaussian copula is native
## TypeScript; mulberry32 + Abramowitz-Stegun normalCdf do not require a library.
##
## Optional (for the --sml profile path, when a real-data profiler is wired in):
##   The recommended profilers (SDV / CTGAN / Gretel / DataSynthesizer / Mimesis /
##   Faker / ydata-profiling / synthpop) are Python packages, not npm packages.
##   They would be shelled out to via the existing PythonHelloWorldOperation
##   pattern (src/operations/python/PythonHelloWorldOperation.ts), not added to
##   package.json. A requirements_profiler.txt under a future
##   scripts/resources/profiler/ directory is the appropriate home for them.
##
## Therefore this patch is a NO-OP at the package.json level. It exists only so
## that the promoter has a single place to record "deps considered and declined."
##
## No diff to apply.
